# wq#2808: tailnet-scoped restrictions live in raw PREROUTING because filter INPUT
# rules sit below tailscaled's `-j ts-input` (ACCEPT all -i tailscale0) and never see
# tailnet packets. mcpw/mcp-backend reaches 3100 via cloudflared on lo, never tailscale0.
-A PREROUTING -i tailscale0 -p tcp -m tcp --dport 3100 -m comment --comment wq2808-commander-3100-tailnet-drop -j DROP
